        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we manufacture thermoformed barrier and non-barrier bowls and trays for food products, such as pet food and soups and other ready-to-eat meals, as well as thermoformed tubs for food products.",
        "start_character": 34940,
        "end_character": 35144
